{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 15248581121881283452,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Adding an Assignment Expression",
      "source_hash": 7795167542646727573,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "대입 표현식 추가하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073366Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 16817920872118816086,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073369Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This PEP adds a new assignment expression to the Python language to make it possible to assign the result of an expression in almost any place.",
      "source_hash": 2810291436959672312,
      "context_hash": 12404272754190045517,
      "translation": "이 PEP는 거의 모든 위치에서 표현식의 결과를 대입할 수 있도록 Python 언어에 새로운 대입 표현식을 추가합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073369Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The new expression will allow the assignment of the result of an expression at first use (in a comparison for example).",
      "source_hash": 9321087505017228602,
      "context_hash": 17572056924009701734,
      "translation": "새 표현식은 (예를 들어 비교에서) 처음 사용할 때 표현식의 결과를 대입할 수 있게 해줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073369Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Motivation and Summary",
      "source_hash": 12373700245849912086,
      "context_hash": 11295897267447455048,
      "translation": "동기와 요약",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073369Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Issue1714448 \"if something as x:\" [1]_ describes a feature to allow assignment of the result of an expression in an if statement to a name.",
      "source_hash": 13225225464737850042,
      "context_hash": 2318055021861860568,
      "translation": "Issue1714448 \"if something as x:\" [1]_ 은 if 문에서 표현식의 결과를 이름에 대입할 수 있게 하는 기능을 기술합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073370Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It supposed that the ``as`` syntax could be borrowed for this purpose.",
      "source_hash": 9333950932660705629,
      "context_hash": 3343346711813966430,
      "translation": "이는 이 목적을 위해 ``as`` 구문을 차용할 수 있다고 가정했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073370Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Many times it is not the expression itself that is interesting, rather one of the terms that make up the expression.",
      "source_hash": 15507132417082335454,
      "context_hash": 11384930373505128747,
      "translation": "흥미로운 것은 표현식 자체가 아니라 표현식을 구성하는 항 중 하나인 경우가 많습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073370Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "To be clear, something like this",
      "source_hash": 14584781633785469001,
      "context_hash": 13425814228705482462,
      "translation": "명확히 하자면, 다음과 같은 것은",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073370Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "seems awfully limited, when this",
      "source_hash": 14560585756621418648,
      "context_hash": 17905426020927821382,
      "translation": "다음이 아마도 원하는 결과일 때",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "is probably the desired result.",
      "source_hash": 8385228223343892202,
      "context_hash": 12001812402621559223,
      "translation": "지나치게 제한적으로 보입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Use Cases",
      "source_hash": 10841861973158336362,
      "context_hash": 483421107044032740,
      "translation": "사용 사례",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See the Examples section near the end.",
      "source_hash": 18179933743232700442,
      "context_hash": 14289936106730716997,
      "translation": "끝부분의 예제 절을 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Specification",
      "source_hash": 12978730460824815227,
      "context_hash": 1838550417175015407,
      "translation": "명세",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A new expression is proposed with the (nominal) syntax",
      "source_hash": 12477112635732420355,
      "context_hash": 15226070411579806148,
      "translation": "(임시로) 다음 구문을 가진 새로운 표현식이 제안됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073372Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "This single expression does the following:",
      "source_hash": 11347721104623240931,
      "context_hash": 16268360596058407430,
      "translation": "이 단일 표현식은 다음을 수행합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:05.073372Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Evaluate the value of ``EXPR``, an arbitrary expression;",
      "source_hash": 2856231348323111505,
      "context_hash": 11595461958159969381,
      "translation": "임의의 표현식인 ``EXPR``\\ 의 값을 평가합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:00.580758Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Assign the result to ``VAR``, a single assignment target; and",
      "source_hash": 7264010124418241157,
      "context_hash": 139482402023420758,
      "translation": "그 결과를 단일 할당 대상인 ``VAR``\\ 에 할당합니다. 그리고",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:00.580764Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Leave the result of ``EXPR`` on the Top of Stack (TOS)",
      "source_hash": 8216130757320167169,
      "context_hash": 13755546945368507520,
      "translation": "``EXPR``\\ 의 결과를 스택 최상단(TOS)에 남깁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:00.580765Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Here ``->`` or (``RARROW``) has been used to illustrate the concept that the result of ``EXPR`` is assigned to ``VAR``.",
      "source_hash": 8160141702686076235,
      "context_hash": 5675751135549707571,
      "translation": "여기서 ``->`` 또는 (``RARROW``)는 ``EXPR``\\ 의 결과가 ``VAR``\\ 에 할당된다는 개념을 나타내기 위해 사용되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:00.580765Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The translation of the proposed syntax is",
      "source_hash": 3166641931978911218,
      "context_hash": 3333490572246813200,
      "translation": "제안된 구문을 옮기면 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:00.580766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "The assignment target can be either an attribute, a subscript or name",
      "source_hash": 15699084790236737809,
      "context_hash": 3282991757111520772,
      "translation": "할당 대상은 어트리뷰트, 서브스크립트, 또는 이름 중 하나일 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:00.580766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "This expression should be available anywhere that an expression is currently accepted.",
      "source_hash": 17524210085121962102,
      "context_hash": 2965932075268184014,
      "translation": "이 표현식은 현재 표현식이 허용되는 모든 위치에서 사용할 수 있어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:00.580766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "All exceptions that are currently raised during invalid assignments will continue to be raised when using the assignment expression.",
      "source_hash": 7583076431621890916,
      "context_hash": 9980923568253839566,
      "translation": "잘못된 할당 시 현재 발생하는 모든 예외는 할당 표현식을 사용할 때도 계속 발생합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:00.580767Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:13/seg:1",
      "source": "For example, a ``NameError`` will be raised when in example 1 and 2 above if ``name`` is not previously defined, or an ``IndexError`` if index 0 was out of range.",
      "source_hash": 2183229535450745380,
      "context_hash": 8154759562497911916,
      "translation": "예를 들어, 위의 예제 1과 2에서 ``name``\\ 이 이전에 정의되지 않았다면 ``NameError``\\ 가 발생하며, 인덱스 0이 범위를 벗어났다면 ``IndexError``\\ 가 발생합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:00.580767Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Examples from the Standard Library",
      "source_hash": 2195078285568862142,
      "context_hash": 9174163325373609343,
      "translation": "표준 라이브러리의 예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "standard library": "표준 라이브러리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:00.580768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The following two examples were chosen after a brief search through the standard library, specifically both are from ast.py which happened to be open at the time of the search.",
      "source_hash": 14555011437360098362,
      "context_hash": 7000492656162808011,
      "translation": "다음 두 예제는 표준 라이브러리를 간단히 검색한 후 선택한 것으로, 특히 검색 당시 마침 열려 있던 ast.py에서 가져온 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "standard library": "표준 라이브러리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:00.580774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Original",
